Description: Let a template range say what kind of template block it is
 A TemplateInfo object may now carry the block's kind (print, tag or
 comment) and a role ("attributes" for a print that outputs a whole
 attribute list). The
 tokenizer already keeps the info object on each template character, so the
 handlers can read it through templateKindOf, isAttributesTemplate and
 isStructuralTemplate. Templates without these fields behave as before.
Author: Numiko
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: no
Test: npm run test:upstream; used by EHP-04 and EHP-05
Last-Update: 2026-10-14
